{"id":"vod_sn_38046","vodId":"38046","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"鬼平","name_cn":"鬼平","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9ea705d606cd4e75e6eaacea1c043213.jpg"},"summary":"《鬼平》讲述了时值江户后期，有一个被极其暴虐的盗贼们称为“鬼”并畏惧着的男人。这个人正是“鬼之平藏”火付盗贼改方·长谷川平藏。火付盗贼改方，是特别警察的一种，不仅负责取缔江户市内外的犯罪，还能去他国抓捕犯罪者，是一个机动性很高的组织。然而平藏并不是个只忠于职务的顽固男人，有时也会对犯罪者手下留情。平藏绝不容许的，是非人道。《盗贼三项》——不杀人，不奸污妇女，不偷盗要倒闭的店——一旦违反这三条，背弃人道的人则决不饶恕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QRd1iULG231/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RvjaaLBuVP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TzLsfjRx8y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/niKVkCfEew1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eHkycGqmyk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BEXcZTpwb61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wZAtvdrE3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r71EGSUqMa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6j00zri23u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WzBP4xRpTH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aiLMgLjELH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bzWXrZwjsj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JiVTDBVeLk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/htp3gSNUkt1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.541Z"}